1
00:01:37,890 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,600
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,840
[Episode 25]

4
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:47,920
Take him back to the county jail

5
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,950
and deal with him according to the law.

6
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:49,759
-Yes.
-Yes.

7
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,070
Move!

8
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:21,190
Could he be...

9
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,230
Child,

10
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,800
these are the kind people

11
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,960
who sought justice for your parents.

12
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,560
Quick, kowtow to them.

13
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,710
Thank you, officers,

14
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:34,810
for bringing justice for my parents.

15
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:39,460
Alright, child.

16
00:02:40,579 --> 00:02:41,730
Get up.

17
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,630
This child was lucky.

18
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:00,190
Back then, when I came forward

19
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:01,000
to claim the bodies

20
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,200
of him and his mother,

21
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,120
I was astonished to find

22
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,590
there was still a breath of life

23
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:07,000
left in his tiny body.

24
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:08,800
Perhaps it was all

25
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,750
predestined by Heaven.

26
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:14,780
He has no interest
in cuju or riding and archery—

27
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:17,680
he only likes tinkering with
shadow puppets.

28
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,750
The art of shadow puppetry in Gutan

29
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:28,210
has someone to carry it on.

30
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,310
Go.

31
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:46,560
Everyone,

32
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,590
what do you think?

33
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,800
We've investigated everything

34
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,520
and managed to clear up

35
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,120
the old case from 6 years ago,

36
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,120
but it's of no help

37
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:59,560
to the case at hand.

38
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,590
According to Du Zhongtao's statement,

39
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:03,840
Sui Bing must've died

40
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,590
before the shadow puppets ran amok
during the lunar eclipse.

41
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:08,050
Deputy General Ji Xun said

42
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:09,630
the eclipse began

43
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:11,240
an hour after Sui Bing left,

44
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,960
so he must have been murdered

45
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,960
within that hour.

46
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,700
If we can find out

47
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:16,500
where he went,

48
00:04:16,529 --> 00:04:17,279
what he did,

49
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:18,310
and whom he met

50
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,390
during that hour,

51
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,430
the mystery

52
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,000
should unravel.

53
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,390
I remember

54
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,720
that last night,

55
00:04:25,010 --> 00:04:26,390
Sui Bing was the only one on duty

56
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:28,040
who could move about freely.

57
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:30,280
He could indeed have gone up to
the Yunding Pavilion

58
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,940
without arousing suspicion.

59
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:34,040
Perhaps he did something,

60
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,480
or perhaps...

61
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,000
He discovered

62
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,860
a secret
that could never be revealed to outsiders.

63
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,980
And so he was silenced?

64
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,480
Exactly.

65
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,600
Looks like

66
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,600
we must go to the Yunding Pavilion.

67
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,430
Wait.

68
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,490
I'll go with you.

69
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,270
We'd better

70
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:56,040
investigate this discreetly.

71
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,190
The more of us go,

72
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,430
the more likely we are to be exposed.

73
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:01,190
Then we'll go back to
the county office first

74
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:02,790
and examine Sui Bing's body.

75
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:03,870
Alright.

76
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,720
Qingyang,

77
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,430
be very careful.

78
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,040
Don't worry.

79
00:05:26,730 --> 00:05:28,190
The side window is tucked away.

80
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,430
If I were Sui Bing,

81
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,310
I'd definitely choose

82
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,720
this spot to spy from.

83
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,170
Third Brother?

84
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,040
Are you okay?

85
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,159
I'm fine.

86
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,420
The blessing ceremony

87
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:02,000
concerns the fate of the nation.

88
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,720
It's my duty,

89
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,260
and I dare not be careless.

90
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:06,630
Your Highness,

91
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:08,960
please forgive my offense.

92
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:10,430
Who's there?

93
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,270
Hurry!

94
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,820
Greetings, Your Highness.

95
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:15,540
May I ask

96
00:06:15,570 --> 00:06:17,160
what happened just now, Your Highness?

97
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,190
Commander,

98
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:23,640
[Divine Constable Tally]

99
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:22,190
I am Divine Constable Li Qingyang

100
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:24,000
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

101
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:25,040
Just now,

102
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,160
I came here to investigate,

103
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:29,890
and His Highness mistook me
for an assassin.

104
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,770
It was all a misunderstanding.

105
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:36,630
Divine Constable Li,

106
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,830
the Yunding Pavilion is a forbidden area.

107
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:39,750
Even I

108
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,240
cannot enter at will.

109
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,000
Still,

110
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,440
thankfully it was a misunderstanding.

111
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:46,830
We, too, have failed in
our duty to guard this place.

112
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:49,159
Fortunately, Your Highness intervened.

113
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,600
Then step aside.

114
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:51,680
Yes.

115
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,430
Let's go.

116
00:07:01,830 --> 00:07:02,750
Are you okay?

117
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,920
Thank you for your concern, Your Highness.

118
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,720
I'm fine.

119
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,950
Thank you for saving me just now.

120
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:09,510
Who was that old man?

121
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:11,750
Master Yun Hai,

122
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,180
the abbot of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

123
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:16,120
Isn't he supposed to be in seclusion?

124
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:18,000
His seclusion is just a cover.

125
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,190
I've

126
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:21,120
fought him before.

127
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:22,720
His martial arts skills

128
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,830
are unfathomable.

129
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:30,040
-You snuck into the pavilion tonight...
-You snuck into the pavilion tonight...

130
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,240
It seems the two of us

131
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,500
are thinking along the same lines again.

132
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:40,600
Did Your Highness find anything?

133
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,360
I saw Ye.

134
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:44,430
The rite of beseeching heaven requires

135
00:07:44,430 --> 00:07:46,159
kneeling for 24 hours.

136
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:48,630
Yet, despite his young age,
he's still holding on.

137
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,690
He's very filial to his grandfather.

138
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,120
He's a good child.

139
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,159
Indeed,

140
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,950
a good child.

141
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,520
All the old palace attendants
who have seen him

142
00:07:58,790 --> 00:08:00,210
say in private

143
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,930
that his appearance

144
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,000
somewhat resembles Yan.

145
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,300
Your Highness.

146
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,630
What are you doing?

147
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,750
Today would've been
my late fourth brother's birthday.

148
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:53,010
Every year on this day,

149
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,870
I weave him

150
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,030
a katydid cage.

151
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:08,510
Third Brother!

152
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:11,160
Third Brother!

153
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:15,370
-Third Brother.
-Your Highness the Fourth Prince.

154
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,100
Shouldn't you be studying

155
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,240
instead of running around?

156
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,630
Be careful. If Father sees you,

157
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:20,890
he'll scold you again.

158
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:24,120
Father would never have the heart
to scold me.

159
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,500
Look what I've got.

160
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,550
Father wove this for me.

161
00:09:27,550 --> 00:09:28,440
Is it pretty?

162
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:39,480
It is.

163
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,510
Here.

164
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,960
Later, I'll ask Father

165
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,510
to weave one for you too.

166
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,390
Yan.

167
00:09:49,890 --> 00:09:50,850
Would you like

168
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,630
a little house for your katydid?

169
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:53,690
I know how to weave.

170
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,250
I'll make one for you, okay?

171
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,270
Really?

172
00:09:57,630 --> 00:10:00,080
Third Brother, you're amazing!

173
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,310
My katydid's going to have a house!

174
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:07,090
My katydid's going to have a house!

175
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:08,270
That's great!

176
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:10,300
My katydid's going to have a house!

177
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,120
So,

178
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,770
you've remembered that all along.

179
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,300
Your Highness,

180
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,840
is there...

181
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,360
something on my face?

182
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,360
I just think you

183
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,840
remind me very much

184
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,390
of someone I once knew.

185
00:10:58,910 --> 00:10:59,770
Doesn't match.

186
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:14,700
Magistrate Du, what brings you here?

187
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:15,840
My Lady,

188
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,440
I noticed you've been working

189
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:20,910
on the case late into the night.

190
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:22,000
You must be very tired.

191
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,660
So I thought I'd come by and ask

192
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:25,640
if you'd like some tea and refreshments.

193
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,400
No need.

194
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:29,360
Forgive my poor timing.

195
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,630
Have you found anything

196
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:41,320
about General Sui's death,
Divine Constable?

197
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:42,360
Not yet.

198
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,510
Not even a single lead?

199
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:49,390
Magistrate Du,

200
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,560
could it be

201
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,360
that you have a clever idea

202
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:57,840
to guide us

203
00:11:57,910 --> 00:11:59,120
out of our confusion?

204
00:12:00,330 --> 00:12:02,210
I'm hardly capable of that.

205
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,000
Get out.

206
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,450
Where are you going?

207
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:16,560
I'm still a bit worried about Li Si.

208
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,730
I'll go check on him.

209
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,750
Look at him.

210
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,550
Our Little Ice Cube

211
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:25,750
is

212
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,440
melting.

213
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,150
Zhenzhu,

214
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,790
take a look at this.

215
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:36,650
Found under Sui Bing's boot sole.

216
00:12:43,150 --> 00:12:44,000
It's moss.

217
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:45,110
Moss?

218
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,000
Blue moss?

219
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:50,560
Send a message back to the Bureau

220
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,190
to ask if there are

221
00:12:51,190 --> 00:12:52,590
any records of blue moss.

222
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:59,450
[Great Virtue Bears All Things]

223
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,000
Sui Bing...

224
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,880
Dragon Saliva Crystal?

225
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:36,480
Sui Bing,

226
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,360
you won't be needing it anyway.

227
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,760
I'll keep it safe for you.

228
00:13:45,750 --> 00:13:46,600
It's mine.

229
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:48,200
It's mine.

230
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,910
Your Highness's heartfelt gesture

231
00:14:33,910 --> 00:14:35,970
will surely reach the Fourth Prince.

232
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:54,630
Tomorrow is the blessing ceremony,

233
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:57,200
yet we still haven't made any progress

234
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,910
on the case of the shadow puppet ghost.

235
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:01,710
Now, we also have Sui Bing's death
to contend with.

236
00:15:02,510 --> 00:15:03,710
What do you plan to do?

237
00:15:03,910 --> 00:15:04,720
Actually,

238
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,750
before I came to Gutan this time,

239
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,840
Chief Xuanyuan already suspected

240
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,750
that Liluo was behind all this.

241
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:13,550
Sure enough.

242
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,840
How could those bandits miss

243
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:18,030
such an important opportunity?

244
00:15:19,010 --> 00:15:20,350
How despicable.

245
00:15:22,750 --> 00:15:24,000
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

246
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,630
I will spare no effort

247
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,400
to root out the Liluo remnants completely.

248
00:15:29,910 --> 00:15:31,840
Since Liluo has come prepared this time,

249
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,360
we must keep a strict watch.

250
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,320
I'll go back now.

251
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,200
Divine Constable Li,

252
00:15:40,850 --> 00:15:42,600
you're an outstanding investigator.

253
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,240
Having a capable official
like you is a blessing

254
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,770
for the people of Great Shi.

255
00:15:58,030 --> 00:15:58,890
Third Brother,

256
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:02,750
having a prince like you...

257
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:06,290
is the true blessing for them.

258
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:33,830
I've run out of
the Demon-Suppressing Pills.

259
00:16:33,830 --> 00:16:35,440
What am I to do from now on?

260
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,200
It's blood.

261
00:16:54,930 --> 00:16:56,760
Why is there blood here?

262
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:59,700
And dripped right on top of lotus leaves.

263
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,790
It flew right over my head!

264
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:05,829
Blood was raining down from the sky!

265
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:17,310
Are you okay?

266
00:17:23,990 --> 00:17:24,780
Meng Rui,

267
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:26,650
I know the truth

268
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:27,990
about how Sui Bing died.

269
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,510
Let's go.

270
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:32,710
Come with me
to the Department of Food Affairs.

271
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:36,440
This lowly servant deserves to die!

272
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,700
I was blind and foolish

273
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,640
not to recognize you, Divine Constable.

274
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:40,440
I just...

275
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,830
lost my head over the money.

276
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:43,790
Otherwise,

277
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:45,200
even if I'd had 10 lives,

278
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:45,900
I wouldn't have dared

279
00:17:45,900 --> 00:17:47,550
to take your money, Divine Constable!

280
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:49,200
Please show mercy, Divine Constable!

281
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,960
Xiaoshan, there's no need for this.

282
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,030
Get up first.

283
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,640
I've already given you the money.

284
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,000
Just keep it.

285
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:03,840
However,

286
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,120
you must answer my questions

287
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,920
truthfully.

288
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:08,960
Yes.

289
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,000
Please ask, Divine Constable.

290
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,550
If I utter a single lie,

291
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:13,880
may Heaven strike me down!

292
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:14,680
Last night,

293
00:18:14,750 --> 00:18:16,160
when the shadow puppets caused trouble,

294
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,790
what exactly did you see?

295
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:19,830
Last night,

296
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,550
after delivering the food,

297
00:18:21,550 --> 00:18:23,160
I was passing by the Langyue Studio

298
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,960
when the sky suddenly darkened.

299
00:18:28,590 --> 00:18:30,390
That shadow flew by really fast.

300
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,900
At that time, I thought

301
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:33,830
I'd run into Yin Jie's ghost.

302
00:18:33,890 --> 00:18:37,520
[Langyue Studio]

303
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,480
So,

304
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,310
I plucked up my courage

305
00:18:37,670 --> 00:18:39,000
and tried to sneak into the Langyue Studio

306
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,310
to see what was going on.

307
00:18:40,310 --> 00:18:41,710
When I climbed upstairs,

308
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:42,750
I saw

309
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,000
General Sui lying dead on the terrace,

310
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,170
covered in blood.

311
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,240
So much blood!

312
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,830
I swear to Heaven,

313
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,170
I had absolutely nothing

314
00:18:50,170 --> 00:18:51,370
to do with it!

315
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,440
It... It was Yin Jie's vengeful spirit.

316
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:54,270
I saw it with my own eyes!

317
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:56,330
The spirit flew right across the sky!

318
00:18:56,510 --> 00:18:58,110
The one flying across the sky

319
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,650
wasn't Yin Jie's vengeful spirit,

320
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:02,110
but Sui Bing.

321
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:03,830
Sui Bing?

322
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:05,960
Xiaoshan,

323
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,600
go back and get some rest.

324
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:09,310
Yes.

325
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,000
Meng Rui,

326
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,590
I found something

327
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:18,570
on the lotus leaves at Tinghe Pond.

328
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:23,440
Of the 4 main buildings
at the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

329
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,310
the principal one, the Tongtian Pavilion,

330
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:26,240
stands 6 stories tall,

331
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,310
about 18 chi high.

332
00:19:27,590 --> 00:19:28,720
This creates

333
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,960
a height difference
between the Tongtian Pavilion

334
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,590
and the other 3.

335
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,590
After killing Sui Bing,

336
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:36,960
the murderer
took advantage of this height difference

337
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:39,440
to move the body
from the Tongtian Pavilion

338
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,350
to the Langyue Studio.

339
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:43,920
This ingenious move not only concealed

340
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:45,180
the traces of the crime

341
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,240
but also neatly

342
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,590
shifted suspicion

343
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:49,070
onto the shadow puppets

344
00:19:49,070 --> 00:19:50,310
that had run amok that night.

345
00:19:50,310 --> 00:19:51,350
This explains

346
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:52,310
why Sui Bing's body

347
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:54,030
was not strung up like the others.

348
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:54,960
Moreover, the Tongtian Pavilion

349
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:55,920
and the Langyue Studio

350
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,960
are not far apart,

351
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:59,240
separated only by Tinghe Pond.

352
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:06,960
If the body

353
00:20:07,110 --> 00:20:09,240
was really transferred through the air,

354
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,790
it must've crossed Tinghe Pond.

355
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,590
I found a few traces of blood

356
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:18,400
on the lotus leaves there.

357
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:21,240
That is enough to support my inference.

358
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,000
As for

359
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:25,170
the other bloodstains on the ground,

360
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:27,000
given the fierce battle that night,

361
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,640
we naturally assumed

362
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:30,240
they were left by wounded soldiers,

363
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,000
so

364
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,720
they didn't draw our attention.

365
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:34,510
But how exactly

366
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:35,590
did they

367
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:36,790
move the body?

368
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,030
There is a stealth weapon in the jianghu

369
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:40,510
called "Back and Forth."

370
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,440
This weapon is made of iron wire

371
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:44,760
that can be extended and reeled in.

372
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,110
If everything you've said is correct,

373
00:20:57,110 --> 00:20:59,440
the murderer must've been inside
the Tongtian Pavilion.

374
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,720
To successfully

375
00:21:00,830 --> 00:21:02,400
move Sui Bing's body

376
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,590
under heavy guard,

377
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,640
the murderer would've needed someone

378
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,840
to create a diversion

379
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:09,310
to draw away the soldiers
on duty that night.

380
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:11,240
But how could the murderer have known

381
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,440
that the Liluo people

382
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:13,590
would drive the shadow puppets

383
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:15,200
to cause trouble that night?

384
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,210
There's only one possibility.

385
00:21:19,350 --> 00:21:20,590
The murderer is from Liluo.

386
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:21,350
Also,

387
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:23,400
the method used to kill Sui Bing

388
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:25,110
was clearly intended to imitate

389
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:26,550
the deaths of the previous 9 victims.

390
00:21:26,550 --> 00:21:28,550
However, Zhenzhu's autopsy results

391
00:21:28,550 --> 00:21:29,830
have never been made public.

392
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:31,000
So how did the murderer

393
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,790
know details

394
00:21:33,110 --> 00:21:35,110
such as the bloody puncture wound
in the neck?

395
00:21:35,110 --> 00:21:36,570
The one who killed Sui Bing

396
00:21:36,590 --> 00:21:38,160
and the killer of the 9 victims

397
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,240
are one and the same—

398
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,900
and that person is from Liluo.

399
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:41,750
Oh no,

400
00:21:42,510 --> 00:21:44,570
the Grand Heir Apparent is in danger.

401
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:45,590
Meng Rui,

402
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:47,750
go to the Langyue Studio
to verify our theory immediately.

403
00:21:47,750 --> 00:21:48,790
I'll go find Prince Ping

404
00:21:48,790 --> 00:21:49,640
and Lord Huo.

405
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,310
Okay.

406
00:21:53,170 --> 00:21:56,070
[Langyue Studio]

407
00:22:18,350 --> 00:22:26,590
[Prosperous Times and Favourable Fortune]

408
00:22:19,350 --> 00:22:20,400
Lord Huo,

409
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,960
Prince Ping and Divine Constable Qingyang

410
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,960
have cleared everyone

411
00:22:25,030 --> 00:22:26,690
out of the Tongtian Pavilion.

412
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,620
The guards are posted outside

413
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:30,340
and will keep watch all night.

414
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:31,550
Good.

415
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,720
Make sure security is airtight.

416
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,510
Yes, sir.

417
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,110
Apart from myself,

418
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:39,200
no one is permitted to come into contact

419
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,600
with His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent.

420
00:22:41,830 --> 00:22:42,640
Understood.

421
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,350
This way,

422
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:57,510
it should be foolproof.

423
00:22:58,490 --> 00:23:01,630
[Gutan County Government]

424
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:11,550
You're finally back.

425
00:23:12,070 --> 00:23:13,480
We were worried about you.

426
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,880
We've made a new discovery

427
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:16,480
regarding Sui Bing's death.

428
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:19,110
We've found a new clue too.

429
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,150
Murder!

430
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,490
Murder!

431
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,360
Murder!

432
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:54,770
Why does

433
00:23:55,070 --> 00:23:56,790
this little puppet look so familiar?

434
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:59,030
It's the Cowherd from
"The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

435
00:23:59,030 --> 00:23:59,830
Right.

436
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:03,000
Shopkeeper Huang
performed that play the other day.

437
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:04,260
Could it belong to him?

438
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,200
This isn't the one

439
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,460
Shopkeeper Huang has.

440
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:11,800
This one is finer

441
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:13,510
and better crafted.

442
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,480
It's clearly no ordinary piece.

443
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,200
This is it.

444
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:21,970
We've found the murder weapon.

445
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,590
This matches

446
00:24:24,030 --> 00:24:25,480
the wounds on Du Zhongtao's body

447
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:26,510
exactly.

448
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,200
To find the murder weapon

449
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,400
used in the 9-victim murder case,

450
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,200
Yan and I

451
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,600
collected every suspicious tool

452
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:33,480
we could find on the market in Gutan.

453
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,720
This was among them:

454
00:24:35,120 --> 00:24:37,580
a carving knife
used to make shadow puppets.

455
00:24:37,960 --> 00:24:38,790
Du Zhongtao

456
00:24:38,830 --> 00:24:40,240
was stabbed 81 times with it.

457
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,550
Eighty-one times?

458
00:24:42,590 --> 00:24:43,720
As the saying goes,

459
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,550
"Slicing flesh with a small knife—

460
00:24:45,550 --> 00:24:46,750
and if the wounds don't kill him,

461
00:24:46,750 --> 00:24:48,110
the pain will."

462
00:24:48,790 --> 00:24:50,880
It seems that this time it was

463
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:53,000
the real shadow puppet ghost who did it.

464
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,110
You mean

465
00:24:54,110 --> 00:24:54,920
Yin Jie?

466
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:56,510
Yin Jie?

467
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,660
Is Yin Jie still alive?

468
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,800
According to official records,

469
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:04,680
Yin Jie fell off a cliff and died

470
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:05,940
while fleeing arrest.

471
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:08,070
The man who led the pursuit back then

472
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:09,670
was this very Magistrate Du.

473
00:25:10,830 --> 00:25:12,200
As the local magistrate,

474
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,580
he failed to deliver justice
for the wronged man

475
00:25:13,580 --> 00:25:14,550
and instead

476
00:25:14,590 --> 00:25:17,000
had him arrested as a criminal.

477
00:25:17,590 --> 00:25:19,400
It's understandable that Yin Jie would

478
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:21,800
seek revenge for his personal grievances.

479
00:25:33,510 --> 00:25:34,400
What's this?

480
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,680
What is it?

481
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,930
The Dragon Saliva Crystal.

482
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:40,000
Dragon Saliva?

483
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:43,550
Is this thing real?

484
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:45,520
Most people never get to see one.

485
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:47,620
Where did Du Zhongtao get it?

486
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,880
How do you know about this?

487
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:52,280
You've seen this before?

488
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:54,110
Just a guess.

489
00:25:54,110 --> 00:25:55,000
Let me see it.

490
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:58,570
Is this something anyone can just look at?

491
00:26:12,580 --> 00:26:13,620
If this really is

492
00:26:13,650 --> 00:26:15,180
the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

493
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,160
then Du Zhongtao

494
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,440
must've lied about

495
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,500
at least one thing.

496
00:26:18,610 --> 00:26:20,880
[Langyue Studio]

497
00:26:19,510 --> 00:26:21,310
When he came to deliver the wine,

498
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,510
he

499
00:26:22,510 --> 00:26:23,350
found

500
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:24,680
the crystal that had fallen

501
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:26,240
from Sui Bing's body.

502
00:26:26,790 --> 00:26:28,240
That's the real reason

503
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:30,070
he chose not to

504
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:31,880
report the body

505
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:32,880
after finding it.

506
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:34,240
But if the killer

507
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:36,240
discovered that Sui Bing
had stolen the crystal,

508
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,720
why didn't he search the body

509
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:39,030
after killing him

510
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:42,240
instead of leaving the crystal on it?

511
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,450
Good question.

512
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:47,880
Think about it.

513
00:26:48,310 --> 00:26:49,830
After Sui Bing was killed,

514
00:26:50,110 --> 00:26:51,770
the killer didn't search him.

515
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,810
But when Du Zhongtao was murdered,

516
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:56,480
the crystal was left in his mouth.

517
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:59,430
It seems the killer did this deliberately.

518
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:00,740
As if

519
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:02,960
he wanted us to know something.

520
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:13,680
As events have unfolded—

521
00:27:14,030 --> 00:27:15,400
the 9-victim murder case,

522
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:17,260
the shadow puppets running amok,

523
00:27:17,510 --> 00:27:18,680
Sui Bing's death,

524
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,110
and Du Zhongtao's murder—

525
00:27:20,110 --> 00:27:22,270
every clue and lead

526
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:24,840
seems to point to the shadow puppet ghost.

527
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,040
But if

528
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:27,240
all of this

529
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:29,530
is a smokescreen orchestrated by Liluo,

530
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,640
then

531
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:32,730
they must be

532
00:27:32,760 --> 00:27:34,690
trying hard to cover up some truth.

533
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,610
So you're saying

534
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:39,070
we've been
barking up the wrong tree all along?

535
00:27:39,070 --> 00:27:40,680
The situation's already so critical.

536
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,480
Li Si,

537
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,840
what should we do now?

538
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,640
Perhaps

539
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:47,570
we should go back to the very beginning

540
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,270
of this whole case.

541
00:27:55,850 --> 00:27:59,520
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

542
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,200
Jiuying,

543
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:58,880
you go keep watch
at the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

544
00:27:58,880 --> 00:27:59,590
Okay.

545
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,280
Dear customers, please come in.

546
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,830
Please have a seat, everyone.

547
00:28:10,830 --> 00:28:11,680
Enjoy some hot soup

548
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,480
to warm up.

549
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,350
Waiter,

550
00:28:13,790 --> 00:28:15,070
how's business been

551
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,480
lately?

552
00:28:17,440 --> 00:28:18,680
So-so, I suppose.

553
00:28:18,830 --> 00:28:20,030
We hope you'll

554
00:28:20,070 --> 00:28:21,040
come back and patronize

555
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:22,570
our little shop more often.

556
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,960
What would you like to eat?

557
00:28:25,830 --> 00:28:26,880
On the 6th of this month,

558
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:27,910
4 diners

559
00:28:27,940 --> 00:28:29,240
died in your shop.

560
00:28:29,310 --> 00:28:30,440
Whatever they ordered,

561
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,440
bring us the same.

562
00:28:31,830 --> 00:28:32,730
Well...

563
00:28:33,100 --> 00:28:34,550
[Divine Constable Tally]

564
00:28:33,510 --> 00:28:34,640
The Divine Constable Bureau is on a case.

565
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:35,880
Just do as you're told.

566
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,920
And call your boss

567
00:28:36,940 --> 00:28:37,740
over here too.

568
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:39,480
Yes.

569
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,590
Boss.

570
00:28:41,270 --> 00:28:42,070
Boss!

571
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:48,170
Nothing in this shop

572
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,750
looks suspicious.

573
00:28:55,750 --> 00:28:56,550
Shopkeeper!

574
00:28:56,550 --> 00:28:58,240
-Shopkeeper!
-The wind's picking up.

575
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,640
It's freezing in here!

576
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:00,720
Why open the windows

577
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:01,700
on such a cold day?

578
00:29:01,700 --> 00:29:02,890
Sorry, sorry!

579
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:04,400
Quick, close the windows!

580
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:05,240
Close them all!

581
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:05,920
Close them all.

582
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,880
Sorry.

583
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,060
It's just too cold.

584
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,230
Sorry, everyone.

585
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:19,480
Freshly steamed buns!

586
00:29:22,030 --> 00:29:23,200
So delicious.

587
00:29:26,110 --> 00:29:27,590
Officers,

588
00:29:27,590 --> 00:29:28,790
what can I do for you?

589
00:29:29,270 --> 00:29:31,600
Is there anything wrong with our service?

590
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:35,440
If there's anything you need...

591
00:30:03,310 --> 00:30:04,260
What's going on?

592
00:30:14,110 --> 00:30:14,920
Yan!

593
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,440
Yan!

594
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,240
Yan!

595
00:30:20,660 --> 00:30:21,510
-Yan.
-Hurry.

596
00:30:21,510 --> 00:30:22,840
-Yan, come on.
-Come on.

597
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,000
How is he?

598
00:30:34,510 --> 00:30:35,570
It's Chiying bugs.

599
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,580
Yan!

600
00:30:45,610 --> 00:30:46,810
Quick, hold him down!

601
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:20,820
How do you feel?

602
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:22,540
-Come on.
-Come on.

603
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:26,830
Yan.

604
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,570
What happened to me?

605
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,720
If it weren't for Zhenzhu,

606
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:47,880
you would've died.

607
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,480
They're all dead.

608
00:31:57,110 --> 00:31:58,750
So this was the cause of death.

609
00:31:58,750 --> 00:32:00,310
No wonder there was no murder weapon.

610
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:02,770
No wonder all 9 victims died
at the same time.

611
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:04,240
But when did the Chiying bugs

612
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,030
get inside

613
00:32:05,050 --> 00:32:06,270
their bodies?

614
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:10,240
Yan,

615
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,400
were you

616
00:32:11,400 --> 00:32:12,680
bitten by a Chiying bug before?

617
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:13,480
Or

618
00:32:14,110 --> 00:32:15,480
did you eat anything

619
00:32:15,830 --> 00:32:17,290
that the rest of us didn't?

620
00:32:18,310 --> 00:32:19,240
No.

621
00:32:23,110 --> 00:32:24,640
The Dragon Pond holy water.

622
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:28,970
The holy water of
the Golden Dragon Pavilion's Dragon Pond!

623
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:45,510
Come on.

624
00:32:58,870 --> 00:32:59,990
These two are fine.

625
00:33:00,310 --> 00:33:01,680
Have either of you ever drunk

626
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:03,640
the Dragon Pond holy water
from the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

627
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:05,500
Neither of us is from around here.

628
00:33:05,550 --> 00:33:08,030
We were only hired 2 days ago.

629
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:10,960
We've never even been
to the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

630
00:33:12,550 --> 00:33:13,400
It's Liluo.

631
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:14,970
Liluo must have

632
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:16,820
tampered with the pond water.

633
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,180
The previous 9 victims

634
00:33:19,070 --> 00:33:20,400
must have drunk it too.

635
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:25,510
The Golden Dragon Pavilion
is always packed with worshippers.

636
00:33:25,510 --> 00:33:27,510
Countless people go there every day

637
00:33:27,510 --> 00:33:28,770
to take the holy water.

638
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,070
I wonder if the Grand Heir Apparent

639
00:33:30,070 --> 00:33:31,110
has drunk any.

640
00:33:45,750 --> 00:33:47,270
Quick, let's go back.

641
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,830
It's the bells
from the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

642
00:33:50,830 --> 00:33:52,510
The rite of beseeching heaven is over.

643
00:33:52,510 --> 00:33:54,770
The blessing ceremony is about to begin.

644
00:33:55,030 --> 00:33:57,230
It's time for the truth to come to light.

645
00:33:58,310 --> 00:33:59,110
Everyone,

646
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,720
let's go.

647
00:34:14,889 --> 00:34:18,219
[Golden Dragon Hall]

648
00:34:35,210 --> 00:34:37,060
[A Tranquil Mind Perceives the Mysteries]

649
00:34:36,510 --> 00:34:38,070
May the gods bless us

650
00:34:38,380 --> 00:34:40,219
and keep Ye safe.

651
00:34:40,840 --> 00:34:42,480
May the gods bless us

652
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:45,190
and keep Ye safe.

653
00:35:06,940 --> 00:35:08,570
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

654
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:12,800
Get out of the way!

655
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,320
Liluo is plotting something.

656
00:35:16,320 --> 00:35:17,840
The blessing ceremony must not proceed!

657
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:19,110
Anyone who disrupts the ceremony

658
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:20,070
shall be executed on the spot!

659
00:35:20,070 --> 00:35:21,280
The pond water has been poisoned!

660
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,480
The Grand Heir Apparent is in danger!

661
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:23,410
Back off!

662
00:35:23,430 --> 00:35:24,570
Back off!

663
00:35:24,590 --> 00:35:25,840
Back off!

664
00:35:32,110 --> 00:35:33,880
Where is the Grand Heir Apparent?

665
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:34,920
In the Golden Dragon Hall,

666
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:36,380
at the blessing ceremony.

667
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:47,320
Meng Rui, Yan,

668
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:49,020
stay here and make sure

669
00:35:49,710 --> 00:35:51,510
no one drinks the holy water again.

670
00:35:51,510 --> 00:35:53,670
Zhenzhu, come with me.

671
00:35:53,690 --> 00:35:54,460
Okay.

672
00:35:54,710 --> 00:35:55,960
We'll hold our ground here.

673
00:35:55,960 --> 00:35:57,670
If we have to, we'll break in.

674
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:58,630
Be careful.

675
00:35:58,840 --> 00:35:59,630
Okay.

676
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,110
Let's go.

677
00:36:46,590 --> 00:36:47,400
Zhenzhu.

678
00:36:51,670 --> 00:36:53,480
Found beneath the prayer cushion.

679
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:55,280
Another Dragon Saliva Crystal.

680
00:36:55,710 --> 00:36:57,440
But why would it appear

681
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:59,960
under the cushion
where the Grand Heir Apparent knelt?

682
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:01,670
What exactly is

683
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:04,520
this so-called Dragon Saliva Crystal?

684
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,160
What's wrong?

685
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:19,480
I didn't notice it earlier
at the county office,

686
00:37:19,480 --> 00:37:20,320
but this

687
00:37:20,550 --> 00:37:21,750
smells like a corpse.

688
00:37:21,780 --> 00:37:22,980
The smell of a corpse?

689
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:24,670
Are you sure?

690
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,970
I can't be mistaken.

691
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:28,320
I know the smell better than anyone.

692
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:39,740
It really is the smell of a corpse.

693
00:37:47,590 --> 00:37:48,400
Li Si.

694
00:37:52,150 --> 00:37:53,670
Yesterday, Yan found blue moss

695
00:37:53,670 --> 00:37:55,110
on the sole of Sui Bing's boot.

696
00:37:55,110 --> 00:37:56,970
This is the reply from the Bureau.

697
00:37:59,110 --> 00:38:00,970
"The 'Notes on Rare Plants' state

698
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:02,760
that among mosses there is a rare variety

699
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:03,670
called Ice Soul Moss,

700
00:38:03,670 --> 00:38:04,840
which resembles frost

701
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:06,500
and has an intense blue color.

702
00:38:06,630 --> 00:38:07,920
There's also an insect

703
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:09,280
called the Frost Moth,

704
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:11,760
which feeds exclusively on this moss
throughout its life

705
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,480
and is even rarer worldwide."

706
00:38:18,550 --> 00:38:21,710
The scales found
on the Grand Heir Apparent's chopsticks...

707
00:38:21,710 --> 00:38:22,520
If Frost Moths

708
00:38:22,540 --> 00:38:24,230
are raised inside the abdomen of a corpse,

709
00:38:24,230 --> 00:38:25,290
the corpse can go

710
00:38:25,310 --> 00:38:27,000
without decaying for years,

711
00:38:27,030 --> 00:38:29,030
appearing exactly as it did in life.

712
00:38:31,310 --> 00:38:32,590
Frost Moth scales

713
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:33,820
turned up, of all places,

714
00:38:33,820 --> 00:38:36,480
on the chopsticks
the Grand Heir Apparent used.

715
00:38:37,710 --> 00:38:38,890
This was

716
00:38:38,910 --> 00:38:40,330
never a Dragon Saliva Crystal.

717
00:38:40,330 --> 00:38:42,080
It's corpse fluid,

718
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:44,320
crystallized by the Frost Moths.

719
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:48,630
Could it be
that the Grand Heir Apparent...

720
00:38:49,670 --> 00:38:50,880
is already dead?

721
00:38:53,820 --> 00:38:55,990
[Yunding Pavilion]

722
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:58,920
You two truly have
sharp eyes, Divine Constables.

723
00:38:58,920 --> 00:39:00,680
You've uncovered

724
00:39:00,700 --> 00:39:02,340
the mystery after all.

725
00:39:03,150 --> 00:39:04,510
Master Yun Hai?

726
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:07,610
Master, you knew from the very beginning?

727
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:13,460
Could it be that...

728
00:39:14,630 --> 00:39:16,130
you are the Liluo spy

729
00:39:16,150 --> 00:39:17,360
hiding inside

730
00:39:17,840 --> 00:39:19,070
the pavilion?

731
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:21,190
I am indeed.

732
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:27,280
Zhenzhu, you go first.

733
00:39:27,710 --> 00:39:28,800
Leave this to me.

734
00:39:29,030 --> 00:39:29,840
Okay.

735
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:30,800
Be careful.

736
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:52,540
You killed

737
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,760
Sui Bing and Du Zhongtao, didn't you?

738
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:56,510
Then why don't you suspect

739
00:39:56,600 --> 00:39:58,730
that I killed the Grand Heir Apparent?

740
00:39:58,760 --> 00:40:00,630
Huo Daozhang has stayed

741
00:40:00,920 --> 00:40:03,180
by the Grand Heir Apparent day and night.

742
00:40:05,070 --> 00:40:07,070
If anything had happened to Zhou Ye,

743
00:40:07,150 --> 00:40:08,480
wouldn't he have known?

744
00:40:09,110 --> 00:40:10,710
There is only one explanation.

745
00:40:10,710 --> 00:40:13,110
The Grand Heir Apparent was already dead

746
00:40:13,550 --> 00:40:15,320
before he came to
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

747
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,700
Huo Daozhang knew perfectly well

748
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,140
that he was escorting

749
00:40:19,140 --> 00:40:20,480
a corpse.

750
00:40:20,510 --> 00:40:22,230
And the one who ordered this

751
00:40:23,070 --> 00:40:25,200
could only have been the Crown Prince.

752
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:26,550
But

753
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:29,290
why would the Crown Prince do this?

754
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,840
Why don't you tell me first

755
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,810
how Sui Bing and Du Zhongtao

756
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:34,230
were killed

757
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,480
and why?

758
00:40:50,030 --> 00:40:51,960
Sui Bing was killed because he went

759
00:40:51,960 --> 00:40:54,280
looking for the crystal
on a sudden impulse.

760
00:40:54,280 --> 00:40:56,670
Du Zhongtao was killed
because he found the crystal.

761
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:58,200
That, too, wasn't planned.

762
00:40:58,710 --> 00:41:00,030
Neither death

763
00:41:00,270 --> 00:41:01,320
was part of

764
00:41:01,710 --> 00:41:03,320
the original plan.

765
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:06,060
At first, I thought

766
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,600
Sui Bing was killed

767
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:09,640
because he had stolen the crystal.

768
00:41:09,670 --> 00:41:11,000
But now it seems

769
00:41:11,230 --> 00:41:12,030
he

770
00:41:12,480 --> 00:41:14,640
must have witnessed something

771
00:41:15,710 --> 00:41:17,760
he was never supposed to see that night.

772
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:18,590
That's why

773
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:20,710
he was silenced.

774
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:22,650
[Yunding Pavilion]

775
00:42:07,800 --> 00:42:08,660
Your Highness?

776
00:42:11,300 --> 00:42:12,160
Your Highness?

777
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:25,880
The... The...

778
00:42:26,510 --> 00:42:27,970
The Grand Heir Apparent is dead.

779
00:42:27,970 --> 00:42:28,970
Your Highness...

780
00:42:29,510 --> 00:42:30,880
I have nothing to do with it.

781
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:32,880
I swear, I have nothing to do with it.

782
00:42:36,070 --> 00:42:36,920
That's...

783
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:49,400
The... The Dragon Saliva Crystal?

784
00:42:53,630 --> 00:42:54,570
It really is...

785
00:42:54,710 --> 00:42:57,240
It really is hidden
in the Golden Dragon Hall.

786
00:43:07,920 --> 00:43:08,710
What...

787
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:13,410
Well... Well...

788
00:43:13,710 --> 00:43:14,510
Master.

789
00:43:14,710 --> 00:43:15,630
Lord Huo,

790
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:18,100
you've been rather careless.

791
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:19,710
Thank you for your help, Master.

792
00:43:19,710 --> 00:43:21,840
I've been following the Crown Prince,

793
00:43:22,360 --> 00:43:25,070
so I must do all I can for him.

794
00:43:31,880 --> 00:43:32,710
This

795
00:43:33,510 --> 00:43:35,390
is the weapon you used

796
00:43:35,420 --> 00:43:37,040
to kill Sui Bing.

797
00:43:38,230 --> 00:43:39,470
After that,

798
00:43:39,550 --> 00:43:41,670
you cut out Sui Bing's heart and liver,

799
00:43:41,670 --> 00:43:43,630
and took advantage of the lunar eclipse

800
00:43:43,630 --> 00:43:45,070
and Liluo's attack

801
00:43:45,070 --> 00:43:46,110
to send the body

802
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:48,530
through the air to the Langyue Studio.

803
00:43:50,210 --> 00:43:51,850
[Yunding Pavilion]

804
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:54,720
You made it look as though

805
00:43:54,840 --> 00:43:57,300
he'd been killed
by the shadow puppet ghost.

806
00:43:58,440 --> 00:43:59,920
Huo Daozhang must've detected

807
00:43:59,920 --> 00:44:00,920
the stench of a corpse

808
00:44:00,920 --> 00:44:03,190
-Du Zhongtao!
-coming from Du Zhongtao.

809
00:44:03,480 --> 00:44:04,440
He figured out

810
00:44:04,630 --> 00:44:05,800
that the crystal

811
00:44:05,830 --> 00:44:07,240
stolen by Sui Bing

812
00:44:07,360 --> 00:44:09,190
had already fallen into Du's hands.

813
00:44:09,190 --> 00:44:10,000
So,

814
00:44:10,150 --> 00:44:13,670
he sent you to eliminate the loose ends.

815
00:44:14,590 --> 00:44:15,400
Master,

816
00:44:16,670 --> 00:44:18,800
although you killed Du Zhongtao,

817
00:44:19,070 --> 00:44:20,490
you deliberately left the crystal

818
00:44:20,490 --> 00:44:22,070
inside his mouth.

819
00:44:22,550 --> 00:44:23,550
You did that

820
00:44:23,920 --> 00:44:25,880
so we would discover

821
00:44:26,320 --> 00:44:28,520
the truth that Zhou Ye was already dead.

822
00:44:29,320 --> 00:44:30,480
Am I right?

823
00:44:36,480 --> 00:44:37,710
Master Yun Hai,

824
00:44:37,920 --> 00:44:40,320
as the abbot
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

825
00:44:40,360 --> 00:44:42,150
you feigned loyalty to the Crown Prince

826
00:44:42,150 --> 00:44:43,050
while secretly

827
00:44:43,280 --> 00:44:45,280
colluding with Liluo's Dark Night.

828
00:44:45,550 --> 00:44:47,570
What exactly are you after?

829
00:44:59,000 --> 00:44:59,800
Move!

830
00:45:00,110 --> 00:45:01,480
-I said, move!
-Stop!

831
00:45:04,320 --> 00:45:05,070
Ms. Bai,

832
00:45:06,070 --> 00:45:07,190
why are you
forcing your way into the main hall?

833
00:45:07,190 --> 00:45:08,050
Your Highness,

834
00:45:09,510 --> 00:45:11,170
the Grand Heir Apparent is...

835
00:45:12,960 --> 00:45:15,240
The Grand Heir Apparent is already dead.

836
00:45:27,550 --> 00:45:29,710
You truly live up to your reputation.

837
00:45:31,320 --> 00:45:34,710
But isn't it a bit too late

838
00:45:35,630 --> 00:45:36,600
to know

839
00:45:37,480 --> 00:45:39,000
the whole story now?

840
00:46:05,110 --> 00:46:06,040
What's going on?

841
00:46:06,510 --> 00:46:07,440
What happened?

842
00:46:13,030 --> 00:46:14,070
What did you do?

843
00:46:24,670 --> 00:46:25,600
What's going on?

844
00:46:28,020 --> 00:46:28,830
Oh no.

845
00:46:29,070 --> 00:46:29,920
Jiuying,

846
00:46:30,320 --> 00:46:31,070
stay here and keep watch.

847
00:46:31,070 --> 00:46:31,840
Meng Rui.

848
00:46:33,670 --> 00:46:34,760
Look! What's happening?

849
00:46:34,760 --> 00:46:35,570
What's going on over there?

850
00:46:35,570 --> 00:46:36,550
Make way!

851
00:46:38,480 --> 00:46:39,320
Ye.

852
00:46:49,870 --> 00:46:50,890
The Dragon King has manifested!

853
00:46:50,890 --> 00:46:52,490
The Golden Dragon King has manifested!
